Subject: [PATCH] Service the original Arcade implementation MSBuild and crypto inputs

Upgrade the four coordinated MSBuild build-helper package properties from
17.3.2 to 17.8.43. Keep XML/CMS and ASN.1 on their fixed .NET 8 servicing
versions: Xml 8.0.5, transitive Pkcs 8.0.2 and Asn1 8.0.2. A direct common
Asn1 reference prevents old NuGet.Packaging dependencies selecting Asn1 5.0.0.
These references belong to Arcade build infrastructure; product MSBuild is
still built from the pinned SDK sources. NuGet auditing remains enabled and
all warnings remain fatal for implementation projects. Historical signature
reference packages and their separately guarded audit disposition are intact.

Complete exact package bytes, publisher source Git objects and licenses must
be retained and checked against actual restore records by the producer.

Advisories: https://github.com/dotnet/msbuild/security/advisories/GHSA-h4j7-5rxr-p4wc
 https://github.com/dotnet/msbuild/security/advisories/GHSA-w3q9-fxm7-j8fq
 https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/security/advisories/GHSA-846f-f764-76mx
 https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/security/advisories/GHSA-447r-wph3-92pm
Base-VMR: 7d1bf90885cff22e7da72b27e9848e42fd3cb1ae
Base-Arcade: 659e244c0464986411ccd6ccf51084c96ae66091

diff --git a/src/arcade/eng/Versions.props b/src/arcade/eng/Versions.props
--- a/src/arcade/eng/Versions.props
+++ b/src/arcade/eng/Versions.props
@@ -24,10 +24,10 @@
     <MicrosoftSymbolUploaderBuildTaskVersion>2.0.0-preview.1.23470.14</MicrosoftSymbolUploaderBuildTaskVersion>
     <MicrosoftSymbolUploaderVersion>2.0.0-preview.1.23470.14</MicrosoftSymbolUploaderVersion>
     <!-- msbuild -->
-    <MicrosoftBuildFrameworkVersion>17.3.2</MicrosoftBuildFrameworkVersion>
-    <MicrosoftBuildTasksCoreVersion>17.3.2</MicrosoftBuildTasksCoreVersion>
-    <MicrosoftBuildUtilitiesCoreVersion>17.3.2</MicrosoftBuildUtilitiesCoreVersion>
-    <MicrosoftBuildVersion>17.3.2</MicrosoftBuildVersion>
+    <MicrosoftBuildFrameworkVersion>17.8.43</MicrosoftBuildFrameworkVersion>
+    <MicrosoftBuildTasksCoreVersion>17.8.43</MicrosoftBuildTasksCoreVersion>
+    <MicrosoftBuildUtilitiesCoreVersion>17.8.43</MicrosoftBuildUtilitiesCoreVersion>
+    <MicrosoftBuildVersion>17.8.43</MicrosoftBuildVersion>
     <!-- netstandard -->
     <NETStandardLibraryVersion>2.0.3</NETStandardLibraryVersion>
     <!-- nuget -->
@@ -62,8 +62,9 @@
     <SystemIOPackagingVersion>7.0.0</SystemIOPackagingVersion>
     <SystemReflectionMetadataVersion>7.0.0</SystemReflectionMetadataVersion>
     <SystemSecurityCryptographyX509CertificatesVersion>4.3.2</SystemSecurityCryptographyX509CertificatesVersion>
-    <!-- Do not move too far ahead of what Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Core depends on (currently >=6.0.0). -->
-    <SystemSecurityCryptographyXmlVersion>6.0.1</SystemSecurityCryptographyXmlVersion>
+    <!-- Keep build-helper XML/CMS/ASN.1 inputs on the fixed .NET 8 servicing line. -->
+    <SystemSecurityCryptographyXmlVersion>8.0.5</SystemSecurityCryptographyXmlVersion>
+    <SystemFormatsAsn1Version>8.0.2</SystemFormatsAsn1Version>
     <SystemTextEncodingsWebVersion>7.0.0</SystemTextEncodingsWebVersion>
     <SystemTextJsonVersion>8.0.5</SystemTextJsonVersion>
     <!-- sdk -->
diff --git a/src/arcade/Directory.Build.targets b/src/arcade/Directory.Build.targets
--- a/src/arcade/Directory.Build.targets
+++ b/src/arcade/Directory.Build.targets
@@ -12,4 +12,9 @@
                                  $([MSBuild]::IsTargetFrameworkCompatible('$(TargetFramework)', 'netstandard2.0'))" />
   </ItemGroup>
 
+
+  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' != ''">
+    <!-- NuGet.Packaging's older transitive ASN.1 must not win over the fixed CMS dependency. -->
+    <PackageReference Include="System.Formats.Asn1" Version="$(SystemFormatsAsn1Version)" />
+  </ItemGroup>
 </Project>
